p/4882240","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T06:54:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925186","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4882240-1844751498219150","game_id":"steam-4882240","kind":"announcement","title":"Interview with Spielemagazin.de","summary":"German press sat down with me about A Dark Cave.We talked about the dark story, why the game stays minimal, the free demo, Steam Next Fest (19-26 October), and the full release on 27 October. Read the interview here (in German): https://www.spielemagazin.de/spiele/interviews/a-dark-cave-entwickler-julian-im-interview/36788If you have not tried the demo yet, it is available for free on Steam.Wishlist the full game if you want to get notified when it releases (there will be a launch discount!).See","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T17:21:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219150","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4882240-1839041357028943","game_id":"steam-4882240","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Demo Now Available!","summary":"Steam Demo Now Available!The wait is over! The A Dark Cave demo is now available on Steam.Step into the darkness, gather resources, build your settlement, and see if you can survive. Every decision matters, and every mistake can cost you.The demo offers a glimpse of the full experience while leaving plenty to discover in the full game.If you enjoy the demo, please consider adding A Dark Cave to your wishlist. It helps the game tremendously and ensures you'll be notified when the full version lau","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T09:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","s